* Auto-generated testbench for voltage divider: R3/R4
* Expected Vout = 3.7 * 0.312500 = 1.1562 V
* Model: ideal passives (exact, unloaded)

VIN VBAT 0 DC 3.7
R3 VBAT VBAT_SENSE 22k
R4 VBAT_SENSE 0 10k

.control
op 
let vout_sim = v(VBAT_SENSE)
let error_pct = abs(vout_sim - 1.15625) / 1.15625 * 100
echo "vout_sim=$&vout_sim error_pct=$&error_pct expected=1.15625" > voltage-divider_R3_R4.out
quit
.endc

.end
